code/__pycache__/
# The repository-wide `*.log` rule (.gitignore:56) targets reproducible build output.
# The logs in this namespace are scientific and acceptance EVIDENCE - profile runs,
# identity checks, the Phase-4 stage log, and the clean-checkout suite outputs cited by
# RESULT.md - and are tracked, per the repository policy that evidence artifacts are
# tracked even when machine-generated.
!evidence/**/*.log
